    "Check the selected folders, then scan again.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Vérifiez les dossiers sélectionnés, puis relancez l’analyse." } } } },
    "Checking local models…": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Vérification des modèles locaux…" } } } },
    "Could not finish setup: %@": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Impossible de terminer la configuration : %@" } } } },
    "Deterministic first": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Déterministe d’abord" } } } },
    "Example: after release, prepare the website page": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Exemple : après publication, préparer la page du site" } } } },
    "Found %lld repositories locally. Nothing was modified.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "%lld dépôts trouvés localement. Rien n’a été modifié." } } } },
    "Installing MCP updates local agent configuration with backups. Restart both agents afterward. This does not publish or upload anything.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "L’installation MCP met à jour la configuration locale des agents avec sauvegardes. Redémarrez ensuite les deux agents. Rien n’est publié ni téléversé." } } } },
    "MCP installation requires the Pro feature. The profile can still be created and exported.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "L’installation MCP nécessite la fonction Pro. Le profil peut tout de même être créé et exporté." } } } },
    "No local model is currently available. The deterministic scan remains usable.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aucun modèle local n’est disponible. L’analyse déterministe reste utilisable." } } } },
    "No local model is ready. The deterministic scanner and manual editor still work completely.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aucun modèle local n’est prêt. L’analyse déterministe et l’éditeur manuel restent entièrement utilisables." } } } },
    "Onboarding progress": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Progression de la configuration" } } } },
    "Private local worker ready at %@. Nothing is sent to a cloud model.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Le moteur local privé est prêt à l’adresse %@. Rien n’est envoyé à un modèle cloud." } } } },
    "One item per line": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Un élément par ligne" } } } },
    "Only tools worth reusing": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Uniquement les outils utiles à réutiliser" } } } },
    "Reading repository metadata locally…": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Lecture locale des métadonnées des dépôts…" } } } },
    "Repository markers, dependency manifests, scripts, and indexed evidence are detected without AI. Every item remains editable before saving.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Les marqueurs de dépôt, manifestes de dépendances, scripts et preuves indexées sont détectés sans IA. Chaque élément reste modifiable avant l’enregistrement." } } } },
    "Reusable product or technical abilities": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Capacités produit ou techniques réutilisables" } } } },
    "Review": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Vérification" } } } },
    "Review every label before activation.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Vérifiez chaque libellé avant l’activation." } } } },
    "Select only projects that should be available as global context.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Sélectionnez uniquement les projets à rendre disponibles comme contexte global." } } } },
    "Step %lld of %lld": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Étape %lld sur %lld" } } } },
    "Step %lld of %lld · %@": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Étape %lld sur %lld · %@" } } } },
    "Suggested by %@ — verify before saving": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Suggéré par %@ — à vérifier avant l’enregistrement" } } } },
    "The local model response was rejected because it did not match the bounded profile schema.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "La réponse du modèle local a été rejetée car elle ne respectait pas le schéma limité du profil." } } } },
    "Throttle scans only folders you choose. It stores a small derived index and a portable profile. It never uploads source code, credentials, transcripts, or the profile from this assistant.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Throttle analyse uniquement les dossiers choisis. Il conserve un petit index dérivé et un profil portable. Cet assistant ne téléverse jamais le code source, les identifiants, les transcriptions ni le profil." } } } },
    "Throttle searches at most three directory levels, ignores build caches and symlinks, and never changes a repository.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Throttle parcourt au maximum trois niveaux, ignore les caches de build et les liens symboliques, et ne modifie jamais un dépôt." } } } },
    "configured host": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "hôte configuré" } } } },
    "1 capability": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "1 capacité" } } } },
    "1 discovery root. The saved profile can later be exported as JSON or YAML.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "1 racine de découverte. Le profil enregistré pourra être exporté en JSON ou YAML." } } } },
